WHAT YOU'LL LEARN IN THIS LESSON
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This lesson focuses on understanding how to organize and manage CSS styling
inside a React project.

You will understand:

• CSS file organization and structure

• Global vs component-specific styling

• CSS file naming conventions

• Importing and applying CSS in React

