IMPORTANT NOTE ABOUT BREAKPOINT VARIABLES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The original lesson listed CSS variables such as:

--breakpoint-mobile: 480px;

and then expected them to be usable in normal media queries.

For traditional CSS, custom properties cannot generally be used directly
as media-query conditions like this:

@media (max-width: var(--breakpoint-mobile))

Therefore, the examples use literal breakpoint values:

@media (max-width: 480px)

@media (max-width: 768px)


