PART 4: COMPONENT-SPECIFIC CSS FILES
================================================================================

COMPONENT CSS FILE PURPOSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Component CSS files contain styles primarily intended for that component.

Benefits:

• Related JSX and CSS stay together

• Easier maintenance

• Easier navigation

• Styling can be removed together with component

• Makes component responsibilities clear

• Supports component-oriented organization


IMPORTANT:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Normal .css files are NOT truly component-scoped.

For true automatic class scoping, consider:

Component.module.css

with CSS Modules.


