METHOD 1: IMPORT COMPONENT CSS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

File:

src/components/Header/Header.jsx


import './Header.css'


export default function Header() {

  return (
    <header className="header">

      {/* Component JSX */}

    </header>
  )
}


WHAT HAPPENS?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• CSS becomes part of the application's imported styles

• Header JSX uses Header-related class names

• Keeping the CSS beside Header improves file organization

• The CSS is NOT automatically technically scoped to Header


